  "summary": "The rights-limited Year B Advent I expansive study passes source review with two distinct four-sense interpretations and accurate sung alternatives from Lectionary no. 174. The revised link delivers the registered Jerome PDF, whose first-person invitation in book XVII, p. 158 moves from confession to Psalm 79:4, while Bede on Mark 13:33\u201337 and Chrysostom\u2019s Homily 2 \u00a7\u00a74\u20138 explain why a gifted household still needs to watch."
